IMAPAccount archive
Host imap.example.com
User you@example.com
PassCmd "age -d -i @HOME@/.config/age/keys.txt @ARCHIVE@/pass.age"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore archive-remote
Account archive

MaildirStore archive-local
Path @ARCHIVE@/Maildir/
Inbox @ARCHIVE@/Maildir/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel archive
Far :archive-remote:
Near :archive-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *